  "scope": "Exact package bundle ownership, package asset-reference closure and clean Creator 3.8.8 import/loading. Complete verify:assets3d remains SC1-B5; asynchronous AssetLease remains SC3; full platform builds and real WeChat cache acceptance are not claimed.",
  "implementation": [
    "kit/plugin-<id>[-<map>] ownership includes root metadata and uses the same rule for collection, validation, locks, conflicts, changed and uninstall. Adjacent package names remain independent. Existing host roots, including orphan root metadata, cannot be aliased by a name differing only in case.",
    "Reusable source/subMeta UUID index resolves full and compressed UUIDs, exact subassets, serialized external references and Creator metadata/database references. Same-package bundles may cross-reference; dangling/cross-package/host references fail, including requires.kits.",
    "The exact built-in effect allowlist pins Creator 3.8.8 source and meta hashes; unknown UUIDs and missing built-in subassets fail.",
    "package3d builder profile selects miniGame remote and native/web local. AssetAddress fixes bundle and extensionless path."
  ],
